cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, cite this software repository and the original methods and datasets listed in the report."
title: "QAAP: quality-aware pulmonary image classification"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Sudarshan
    given-names: Rahul
repository-code: "https://github.com/RS1321/QAAP-Final"
url: "https://github.com/RS1321/QAAP-Final"
abstract: >-
  Research implementation of quality-aware preprocessing, frozen lung cropping,
  convolutional classifiers and out-of-fold logistic stacking for four-class
  chest radiograph classification, with calibration, external transfer analysis,
  ablations, Grad-CAM and measured latency. Results describe one completed run.
keywords:
  - chest radiographs
  - quality-aware preprocessing
  - out-of-fold stacking
  - reproducibility
